.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH maw-help 1  "maw-help " 
.SH NAME
maw\-help \- read the docs: a topic, a command, or any section by its heading
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmaw help\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIQUERY\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
read the docs: a topic, a command, or any section by its heading
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIQUERY\fR]
usage, modules, formats, a command, or a heading like `drift`
